From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:47:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: debugfs fw_mem, a read-only view of bootstrap
 firmware memory (#186)

Debug only, no uapi: asahi_m4/fw_mem reads the firmware regions that are
allocated at bootstrap and never released (root, bundle, shared extent,
private heaps, shared pages, compute queue). File offset is the firmware
VA minus 0xffff_fc00_0000_0000, in whole words. Reads take no driver lock
and do no cache maintenance. For sampling the firmware's power and
performance controller state under load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
